.TH octosnap-annotate 1  OctoSnap 
.SH NAME
octosnap\-annotate \- Open an image, or a .octosnap project, in the annotation editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBoctosnap annotate\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPATH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open an image, or a .octosnap project, in the annotation editor
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPATH\fR>
The file, or `\-` to read an image from standard input
